  "comments": "<p>KM#145 and KM#149 are very similar, with varieties of the size of the head (obverse) and letters (reverse):<br>- KM#145 (Type A): larger head, smaller crown, and letters; legend far from the rim<br>- KM#149.1 Type B: smaller head, large letters, broad rim, larger crown<br>- KM#149.1 Type C: larger head, large letters, broad rim<br>- KM#149.2: medal alignment</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>1977 normal / large larynx</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6875099b738de.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6875099b738de.jpg\"></a><br><br>Schön# 97 includes both KM# 145 and KM# 149.</p>",
